=={{Icons|Overview}} '''Overview'''==
'''Yuletide Savior's Cape''' is a limited accessory that was able to be obtained by completing the [[Yuletide 2024|Yuletide 2024 Event's]] questline, alongside getting the [[Reindeer Figurehead]]. Since the conclusion of the [[Yuletide 2024]] event, it has been made unobtainable except through [[Trading]] and the [[Marketplace]].

