== {{Icons|Overview}} Overview ==
Captain Maria's Cape is one out of six boss drops from [[Captain Maria]]. It is upgradable up to level 210 but as of Port Mistral update it can only be upgraded to level 140. It can hold up to two jewel slots. Captain Maria spawns in the Forest of Masts, located in the northern part of the Nimbus Sea.

Captain Maria's Cape takes the appearance of a black cape lined with red on the edge of the cape. It is undyeable. At base it requires level 110+ to equip.
