=={{Icons|Overview}} Overview==
The Lance of Loyalty is a [[Weapons|Strength Weapon]] and a drop of [[General Argos]], starting at level 80.

It is unique in that it is a Strength weapon, meaning its skills can be obtained with the '''needed Strength and Weapon Stats only''', meaning it is locked to [[Warlord]] [[Stat Builds]] and [[Savant]] [[Stat Builds]], much like the [[Lion's Halberd]], another drop from General Argos. It is a [[Rapiers|Rapier]] type weapon, but visually appears as a lance. 
