==Trivia== 
*[[Vetex]] stated that the weapon is mainly for ceremonial purposes and General Argos is using it because he is a "Chad".<ref>https://forum.arcaneodyssey.dev/t/argoss-spear-sucks-both-ingame-and-realistically/112699/36</ref>
**He also said that the Lance of Loyalty was lighter than its counterpart the [[Lion's Halberd]], due to being crafted using a less dense alloy
*The weapon's model appears in [[World of Magic]] as a weapon held by a statue in the Bronze Grasslands. (This weapon is not the actual Lance of Loyalty, they just have the same model.)
*The model in question is taken from [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Catalog:Snow_Knight_Lance Snow Knight Lance] gear

